<title>GERMANY: Walter Bau - H1 gp construction output up.</title>
<headline>Walter Bau - H1 gp construction output up.</headline>
<dateline>AUGSBURG, Germany 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group construction output	     1,993   vs 1,873</p>
<p>    Parent construction output	    651     vs 774</p>
<p>    Incoming orders			   2,643   vs 1,993</p>
<p>    Group workforce			   13,976  vs 12,415</p>
<p>    Parent workforce			  3,409   vs 4,369</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Walter Bau AG. The group said it recorded a fall in operating profits in the first half of 1996 without giving further details. It blamed the fall on the difficult trading conditions in the construction sector.</p>
</text>
